DIFF comment-only: "(a int,b text)" -> "(a int,/*c*/b text)"
SAME comment-only: "a int, b" -> "a int,/*c*/ b" (space already there)
SAME comment-only at line end: "x -- c" 
DIFF comment-only trailing comment w/o newline sep: "SELECT 1;SELECT 2;" -> "SELECT 1;--c\nSELECT 2;"
DIFF whitespace-only: newline between statements added (";SELECT" -> ";\nSELECT")
SAME whitespace-only: run width "a  b" vs "a b"
SAME whitespace-only: indentation reflow of multi-line stmt
DIFF whitespace-only: prettier-style "( a int )" vs "(a int)"
SAME trailing newline
SAME CRLF vs LF in multi-line string literal
SAME CRLF vs LF in dollar-quoted body
DIFF keyword case
DIFF quoted vs unquoted identifier "t" vs t
SAME dependsOn order
SAME dependsOn duplicate
SAME explicit execution.role=owner vs default role owner
SAME explicit lockTimeout 5s vs engine default
SAME 1m vs 60s
DIFF PROJECT default lockTimeout 5s(absent) vs 10s, manifest silent
SAME PROJECT default statementTimeout absent vs 15m (=engine)
DIFF PROJECT default searchPath [public] vs [public,extensions], manifest silent
SAME YAML: key order / quoting not hashed (same JSON)
DIFF unknown extra manifest key
SAME NFC vs NFD in line comment (comment dropped)
DIFF NFC vs NFD in identifier
DIFF semicolon ";" vs ";;"
DIFF trailing ";" absent
